{"agent":"lane-gm-core","data":{"fix_task":"fix-B6cbaeebc00","found_evidence":"ddflow review GM-ci-path-normalise --gate rubber_duck,critic --force --reason x --approval request -> ddflow: error: unrecognized arguments: --approval request","item":"GM-ci-path-normalise","repro":{"bytes":7062,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:65a9cb51110cdf14e115e0686e2d077b3400bb1a3d0844725d45f5c8f5d5dbff","truncated":false},"severity":"medium","summary":"After [review].max_rounds (6) rounds the refusal says to ask the operator for `ddflow review ... --force --reason`, but `ddflow review` accepts no --approval request (argparse error), so an agent cannot file the operator approval the way gate skip and merge can. Also a round is charged when the reviewer repeats findings already triaged as not applicable (docs row for a task with no knob), so a six-round budget is spent on repeats.","title":"review budget spent leaves an agent no approval route: ddflow review has no --approval flag"},"id":"e4b9ea79c9080ee5d2f980760","kind":"bug.found","lamport":183767,"schema":1,"subject":"B6cbaeebc00","ts":"2026-11-12T14:15:06.712742Z"}
{"agent":"lane-gm-core","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B6cbaeebc00: After [review].max_rounds (6) rounds the refusal says to ask the operator for `ddflow review ... --force --reason`, but `ddflow review` accepts no --approval request (argparse error), so an agent cannot file the operator approval the way gate skip and merge can. Also a round is charged when the reviewer repeats findings already triaged as not applicable (docs row for a task with no knob), so a six-round budget is spent on repeats. Found on GM-ci-path-normalise.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B6cbaeebc00 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B6cbaeebc00 --regression-test <test>` first).\n\nNot attached, they match nothing in the tree: ddflow/services/ci/failure_text.py, tests/test_ci_failure_text_paths.py.","fixes":["B6cbaeebc00"],"globs":["ddflow/templates/prompts/help/gates.md","ddflow/services/gates/baseline_red.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"P-green-main","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix","no-deps"],"title":"Fix bug B6cbaeebc00: review budget spent leaves an agent no approval route: ddflow review has no --approval flag"},"id":"e19b200a3e814baca046cda7c","kind":"task.added","lamport":183768,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B6cbaeebc00","ts":"2026-11-12T14:15:06.907966Z"}
